{"title": "Panicked Sentinel (Condition)", "pageid": 45199, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Panicked_Sentinel_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Panicked Sentinel Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Panicked_Sentinel_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Panicked Sentinel</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This paranoiac Spectator will immediately fire a random Eye Ray at any creature it can see that moves within 6 m (20 ft) of it. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SPECTATOR_EYEBEAM_INTERRUPT_AURA</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSPECTATOR_EYEBEAM_INTERRUPT_AURA%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSPECTATOR_EYEBEAM_INTERRUPT_AURA%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>This condition grants the Spectator a reaction that uses one of the following actions:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysing Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysing_Ray\" title=\"Paralysing Ray\">Paralysing Ray</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confusion Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Confusion_Ray\" title=\"Confusion Ray\">Confusion Ray</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Ray\" title=\"Fear Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fear Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Ray\" title=\"Fear Ray\">Fear Ray</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wounding_Ray\" title=\"Wounding Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wounding Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wounding_Ray\" title=\"Wounding Ray\">Wounding Ray</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Panicked_Sentinel\">Creatures with Panicked Sentinel</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/30px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/45px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/60px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/30px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Fires a random Eye Ray at any creature within 6 m (20 ft).</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2021/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20316/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7637/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: